,"surface":"辟陽侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005460","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-097-luli:p018","chapter_id":"c-shiji-097-luli"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m018-0011","start":11,"end":14,"surface":"辟陽侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005460","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-097-luli:p018","chapter_id":"c-shiji-097-luli"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m018-0046","start":46,"end":49,"surface":"辟陽侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005460","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-097-luli:p018","chapter_id":"c-shiji-097-luli"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m018-0056","start":56,"end":59,"surface":"辟陽侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005460","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-097-luli:p018","chapter_id":"c-shiji-097-luli"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m018-0116","start":116,"end":119,"surface":"辟陽侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005460","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-097-luli:p018","chapter_id":"c-shiji-097-luli"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m018-0139","start":139,"end":142,"surface":"辟陽侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005460","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-097-luli:p018","chapter_id":"c-shiji-097-luli"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m018-0160","start":160,"end":163,"surface":"辟陽侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005460","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-097-luli:p018","chapter_id":"c-shiji-097-luli"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m018-0171","start":171,"end":174,"surface":"辟陽侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005460","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-097-luli:p018","chapter_id":"c-shiji-097-luli"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m018-0211","start":211,"end":214,"surface":"辟陽侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005460","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-097-luli:p018","chapter_id":"c-shiji-097-luli"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m018-0215","start":215,"end":218,"surface":"辟陽侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005460","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-097-luli:p018","chapter_id":"c-shiji-097-luli"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m018-0232","start":232,"end":235,"surface":"辟陽侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005460","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-097-luli:p018","chapter_id":"c-shiji-097-luli"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m018-0236","start":236,"end":239,"surface":"辟陽侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005460","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-097-luli:p018","chapter_id":"c-shiji-097-luli"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m019-0011","start":11,"end":14,"surface":"辟陽侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005460","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-097-luli:p019","chapter_id":"c-shiji-097-luli"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m020-0010","start":10,"end":13,"surface":"辟陽侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005460","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-097-luli:p020","chapter_id":"c-shiji-097-luli"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-shiji097-019","person_id":"cbr-p005460","title":"辟陽侯","kind":"noble_rank","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-097-luli","source_id":"s-shiji-097-luli","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-097-luli:p017","quote":"平原君為人辯有口，刻廉剛直，家於長安。行不茍合，義不取容。辟陽侯行不正，得幸呂太后。時辟陽侯欲知平原君，平原君不肯見。及平原君母死，陸生素與平原君善，過之。平原君家貧，未有以發喪，方假貸服具，陸生令平原君發喪。陸生往見辟陽侯，賀曰：「平原君母死。」辟陽侯曰：「平原君母死，何乃賀我乎？」陸賈曰：「前日君侯欲知平原君，平原君義不知君，以其母故。今其母死，君誠厚送喪，則彼為君死矣。」辟陽侯乃奉百金往稅。列侯貴人以辟陽侯故，往稅凡五百金。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji097-019:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-097-luli:p017","start":29,"end":32,"surface":"辟陽侯","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m017-0029","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"實授、敘事用稱與自立分存；死亡不自動終止官爵。陸賈病免依官職承接，文帝時陳丞相言陸生為太中大夫保留用稱，不冒作明示拜授。朱建後復事黥布不等於明示復相。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji097-023","person_id":"cbr-p005460","scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-097-luli"],"status":"contextual_provisional","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","surfaces":["辟陽侯"],"evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-097-luli:p017","quote":"平原君為人辯有口，刻廉剛直，家於長安。行不茍合，義不取容。辟陽侯行不正，得幸呂太后。時辟陽侯欲知平原君，平原君不肯見。及平原君母死，陸生素與平原君善，過之。平原君家貧，未有以發喪，方假貸服具，陸生令平原君發喪。陸生往見辟陽侯，賀曰：「平原君母死。」辟陽侯曰：「平原君母死，何乃賀我乎？」陸賈曰：「前日君侯欲知平原君，平原君義不知君，以其母故。今其母死，君誠厚送喪，則彼為君死矣。」辟陽侯乃奉百金往稅。列侯貴人以辟陽侯故，往稅凡五百金。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-097-luli:p018","quote":"辟陽侯幸呂太后，人或毀辟陽侯於孝惠帝，孝惠帝大怒，下吏，欲誅之。呂太后慚，不可以言。大臣多害辟陽侯行，欲遂誅之。辟陽侯急，因使人欲見平原君。平原君辭曰：「獄急，不敢見君。」乃求見孝惠幸臣閎籍孺，說之曰：「君所以得幸帝，天下莫不聞。今辟陽侯幸太后而下吏，道路皆言君讒，欲殺之。今日辟陽侯誅，旦日太后含怒，亦誅君。何不肉袒為辟陽侯言於帝？帝聽君出辟陽侯，太后大驩。兩主共幸君，君貴富益倍矣。」於是閎籍孺大恐，從其計，言帝，果出辟陽侯。辟陽侯之囚，欲見平原君，平原君不見辟陽侯，辟陽侯以為倍己，大怒。及其成功出之，乃大驚。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-097-luli:p019","quote":"呂太后崩，大臣誅諸呂，辟陽侯於諸呂至深，而卒不誅。計畫所以全者，皆陸生、平原君之力也。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-097-luli:p020","quote":"孝文帝時，淮南厲王殺辟陽侯，以諸呂故。文帝聞其客平原君為計策，使吏捕欲治。聞吏至門，平原君欲自殺。諸子及吏皆曰：「事未可知，何早自殺為？」平原君曰：「我死禍絕，不及而身矣。」遂自剄。孝文帝聞而惜之，曰：「吾無意殺之。」乃召其子，拜為中大夫。使匈奴，單于無禮，乃罵單于，遂死匈奴中。"}],"rationale":"按酈生、陸賈與朱建分傳及敘事承接限定異稱；尉他尉佗原字分存。平原君據明示朱建另候選；朱建兩處未名子尚不合併，淮陰侯與單稱韓信跨篇同指待證。引語古王及神話人物與當事人分開。"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:p017","text":"平原君為人辯有口，刻廉剛直，家於長安。行不茍合，義不取容。辟陽侯行不正，得幸呂太后。時辟陽侯欲知平原君，平原君不肯見。及平原君母死，陸生素與平原君善，過之。平原君家貧，未有以發喪，方假貸服具，陸生令平原君發喪。陸生往見辟陽侯，賀曰：「平原君母死。」辟陽侯曰：「平原君母死，何乃賀我乎？」陸賈曰：「前日君侯欲知平原君，平原君義不知君，以其母故。今其母死，君誠厚送喪，則彼為君死矣。」辟陽侯乃奉百金往稅。列侯貴人以辟陽侯故，往稅凡五百金。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m017-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"平原君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005448","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m017-0029","start":29,"end":32,"surface":"辟陽侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005460","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m017-0038","start"